      ["Think about the central process, evidence, and context behind mixed economy."],
      ["मिश्रित अर्थव्यवस्था के पीछे की मुख्य प्रक्रिया, प्रमाण और संदर्भ पर ध्यान दें।"],
      "The quoted claim is misleading. The correct reasoning is: a mixed economy combines private enterprise with public sector planning and welfare roles.",
